[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7620.95, "timestamp": "02:07:00", "text": "然后是最后一个“是”。是的。有点……呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7622.87, "timestamp": "02:07:02", "text": "稍后可以解释。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7624.149, "timestamp": "02:07:04", "text": "让我们像第一次升级那样结束吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7626.95, "timestamp": "02:07:06", "text": "因为你和你一样，都会达到五级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7629.03, "timestamp": "02:07:09", "text": "因为其他人都差不多是五级左右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7631.83, "timestamp": "02:07:11", "text": "出色地。所以，如果我点击这里，让我看看会怎样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7634.069, "timestamp": "02:07:14", "text": "你没有任何选择。任何其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7637.189, "timestamp": "02:07:17", "text": "选项。呃，不，暂时不要填充内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7638.55, "timestamp": "02:07:18", "text": "好吧，没事了。你没有选择余地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7639.99, "timestamp": "02:07:19", "text": "好的。所以，我要快速地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7643.35, "timestamp": "02:07:23", "text": "填满你的嗯你的拼写你的你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7645.51, "timestamp": "02:07:25", "text": "施法之后，你就可以尝试搞砸了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7647.99, "timestamp": "02:07:27", "text": "摆弄它。嗯，让我想想。嗯，让我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7649.43, "timestamp": "02:07:29", "text": "让我帮你填写。我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7651.27, "timestamp": "02:07:31", "text": "我觉得我不需要再分享这件事了。让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7653.589, "timestamp": "02:07:33", "text": "停止直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7655.83, "timestamp": "02:07:35", "text": "你觉得人们会用这种软的还是软的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7659.51, "timestamp": "02:07:39", "text": "比如在浏览器上玩，或者他们玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7663.99, "timestamp": "02:07:43", "text": "它有点像现实生活中的桌面游戏？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7665.83, "timestamp": "02:07:45", "text": "嗯，这取决于你想怎么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7669.189, "timestamp": "02:07:49", "text": "玩，但人们，呃，比如对我来说，我通常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7671.03, "timestamp": "02:07:51", "text": "在线玩，但有些人也喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7675.35, "timestamp": "02:07:55", "text": "在桌子上亲自玩“嗯嗯”游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7678.629, "timestamp": "02:07:58", "text": "他们是如何记住事情的？我的天啊。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7679.136, "timestamp": "02:07:59", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hewwo"}]